msgctxt "156"
msgid "Dammit...! I'm not gonna let you mess this up!"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "168"
msgid "Yoshio... Please stop doing all this."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "180"
msgid "Akemi! What are you doing here?"
msgstr "Saejima! Che ci fai qui?"

msgctxt "204"
msgid ""
"A police officer was asking me all these questions about a convenience store"
" robbery and some investigation. I didn't want to believe it."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "216"
msgid "Well, I did it... But this is the only way I can make you happy!"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "228"
msgid ""
"Because my ex left me in debt? That's not anything for you to worry about, "
"Yoshio."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "240"
msgid ""
"But, Akemi, you're pregnant! What are we gonna do about the baby? What kind "
"of father would I be if I let our child start out life in debt!?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "252"
msgid ""
"If we keep working hard, we can make it through somehow. What am I gonna do "
"if you're arrested? What do I tell him when he asks about you?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "264"
msgid "I just... I don't know..."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "276"
msgid "(So that's what this is all about.)"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "288"
msgid ""
"Turn yourself in. It's your first offense, right? And no money was stolen, "
"so it's a petty crime you won't be getting locked up for."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "300"
msgid "But..."
msgstr "Ma..."

msgctxt "312"
msgid ""
"And think about your kid. It's a lot harder to have a dad in jail than "
"parents in debt, right?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "324"
msgid ""
"That's right. And what if you're not there when our child is born, Yoshio? I"
" just couldn't deal with that..."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "336"
msgid "Akemi..."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "348"
msgid "I'll go with you to the police."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "360"
msgid "...All right."
msgstr "...Va bene."

msgctxt "372"
msgid ""
"You know, I actually feel kinda grateful to you, guy. You helped us sort out"
" this mess, so I'm gonna turn myself into the cops now."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "384"
msgid "And you were right. I wanna clean myself up before I hold my kid."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "396"
msgid ""
"Well, it's time for us to pay a visit to the police now. Thanks for all your"
" help."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "432"
msgid "Officer? Yeah... I found the suspect at Children's Park in Kamurocho."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "444"
msgid "What are you doing!? Don't call the cops!"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "456"
msgid ""
"Stop it, Yoshio! This is what's best for us! We didn't have the courage to "
"do it ourselves."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "468"
msgid ""
"Pay for the crime and clean yourself up again for the sake of our child. "
"Please..."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "480"
msgid "Akemi..."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "492"
msgid ""
"Thank you for all the help. Now we can sort out this mess once and for all."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "504"
msgid "......"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "564"
msgid ""
"You're the thief, aren't you! Those clothes and that face match up with the "
"report from the convenience store!"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "576"
msgid "Wait for me, Akemi. I'll pay for this and come back for you."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "588"
msgid "You know I will. Please come back soon."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "600"
msgid ""
"You're the one who contacted us, right? We appreciate your cooperation in "
"this case!"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "612"
msgid "I'm sorry about all the trouble we've caused you..."
msgstr "Scusa per tutti i casini che ho combinato..."

msgctxt "636"
msgid "Run. I never saw you."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "648"
msgid "Wha..."
msgstr "Co..."

msgctxt "660"
msgid "No! If he runs now, he'll be on the run for the rest of his life!"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "672"
msgid "How could you say such an irresponsible thing!?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "684"
msgid "......"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "696"
msgid ""
"I don't want our child to learn to be the kind of person who doesn't own up "
"to his mistakes."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "708"
msgid ""
"And I don't want our child to be ashamed of his own father! Please don't do "
"this to us!"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "720"
msgid "Akemi..."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "732"
msgid ""
"Turn yourself in, Yoshio. Pay for your mistakes and come back a new man."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "744"
msgid ""
"I promise I'll wait for you for as long as it takes. I'll be waiting with "
"our child."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "756"
msgid "You're right, Akemi. I'm so sorry about all this..."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "768"
msgid "......"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "780"
msgid ""
"You know, I actually feel kinda grateful to you, buddy. You helped us sort "
"out this mess, so I'm gonna turn myself into the cops now."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "792"
msgid ""
"And it's just like Akemi said. I wanna clean myself up before I hold my kid."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "804"
msgid ""
"Well, it's time for us to pay a visit to the police now. Thanks for all your"
" help."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "876"
msgid "...And that's what happened."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "888"
msgid "I see."
msgstr "Capisco."

msgctxt "900"
msgid "That robber knew he was making a mistake all along."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "912"
msgid ""
"And robbing a convenience store wouldn't get him nearly enough to pay off "
"that heavy debt anyway."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "924"
msgid ""
"You know, I've got a little one of my own, and I can sort of empathize with "
"how panicked that guy must've been."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "936"
msgid ""
"I'll go give my testimony to the police now, and I'll do what I can to get "
"him a lighter sentence."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "948"
msgid "......"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "960"
msgid ""
"Oh, yeah, and here's that payment I promised you. It's not much, but I'd "
"like you to take it."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "972"
msgid "You got <Color:8>30,000 yen<Color:Default>."
msgstr "Hai ottenuto <Color:8>30.000 yen<Color:Default>."

msgctxt "984"
msgid "Well, I'd better get going."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "1056"
msgid "You got 3,000 EXP."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "1080"
msgid "Hey!"
msgstr "Ehi!"

msgctxt "1152"
msgid "You've got nowhere else to run."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "1164"
msgid "How the hell did you find me? I'm not going to the cops!"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "1188"
msgid "Urge Him to Turn Himself In"
msgstr ""

